# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which git ignores) and fill in the real value.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are bundled into the app, so never put secrets here.
#
# Base URL of the store API, without a trailing slash.
# Start the API first (docs/APP_API_GUIDE.md), then set one of these and restart Expo with -c.
# iOS simulator:        http://localhost:5001/api
# Android emulator:     http://10.0.2.2:5001/api
# A phone on your Wi-Fi: http://<this computer's LAN address>:5001/api
# Leave it empty and the app shows "not connected" instead of pretending to sign in.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
